{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-unit-modulus-eigenvalue","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:unit-modulus-eigenvalue","kind":"proposition","title":"Eigenvalues of even braids on $V_{(2,1)}$ and the Borromean trace","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-borromean-markov-trace-closed-form","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-hoefsmit-binding-amplitude"],"tags":["eigenvalue","unit-modulus","borromean","meson","wedderburn","standard-rep"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.borromean_trace_standard","text":"unit-modulus-eigenvalue.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:unit-modulus-eigenvalue\"></a><p><em>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code> be a braid word of even length in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_3(q)</code>. On the standard representation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\rho_{(2,1)}</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\det \\rho_{(2,1)}(\\beta) = 1</code>, so the two eigenvalues satisfy <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_1 \\lambda_2 = 1</code>. They lie on the unit circle exactly when <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\chi_{(2,1)}(\\beta)</code> is real with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">|\\chi_{(2,1)}(\\beta)| \\le 2</code>; this is not automatic. For the Borromean braid <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta_{\\mathrm{Bor}} = (\\sigma_1\\sigma_2^{-1})^3</code>,</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\chi_{(2,1)}(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Bor}})\n  \\;=\\;\n  -\\frac{(q^4 - q^2 + 1)(q^8 - 2q^6 - 2q^2 + 1)}{q^6},</code></pre>\n<p><em>which equals <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code> at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q = 1</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unit-modulus-eigenvalue.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.4.31","page":"b/prop-unit-modulus-eigenvalue","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:BraidKnotOctonion.UnitModulusEigenvalue.borromean_trace_standard","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/BraidKnotOctonion/UnitModulusEigenvalue.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
